WEBVTT

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.190
A Shocking Confession - Magazine Exclusive - Matsuyama Menou: "I never sang"

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.190
"The singing was dubbed. - The compositions and performances were also done by someone else."

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.200
"I wrote the lyrics."

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.200
"This was what I intended to do from the start. Nobody told me to do this."

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.190
Why? In the end, the reasons are still not clear.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.370
In front of our eyes, the double sings for us.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.500
Matsuyama Menou: "I actually never sang"

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.880
M&M Matsuyama Menou - Dubbing Scam

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.880
Within the Idol Industry... and its darkness - Truancy, misconduct, delinquency... and dubbing

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.670
The shocking past of Matsuyama Menou, as reported herself

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.550
President Ogata does not seem to be home.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.960
Is he really not in, or is he just pretending?

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.930
We are here in front of Ogata Productions.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:44.600
We just spoke with an employee,

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.610
and it seems Ogata Eiji-san still has not come to work yet.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.270
We remain in search of his whereabouts.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:27.910
What is...

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:28.920
This?

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.150
She's my idol.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.620
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.620
Sleep, for now

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:53.500
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:53.500
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:14.550
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:14.550
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:20.030
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:20.030
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:27.760
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:27.760
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:36.630
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:36.630
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:44.540
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:44.540
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:50.140
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:50.140
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:54.650
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:54.650
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.940
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.940
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.200
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.200
I don't mind losing anything else

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:08.700
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:08.700
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.200
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.200
Find the real me

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:18.260
zutto matteru

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:18.260
I'll be waiting forever

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:23.450
Talent Information Center

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:23.430
An outrageous piece of news comes to us this morning.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.850
Ogata Eiji-san, once known as the "Charisma of Rock",

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:30.710
and who now oversees his own production company as its President,

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:34.400
is now suspected of fraud and tax evasion regarding several pieces of artwork-

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.690
I apologize, but I must restrict your freedom.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.140
It's okay.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:44.340
Also, please do not speak with anyone outside for now.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.340
I understand, I'll be fine.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.670
That aside, how is Ogata-san?

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:57.270
Page 24
The night will not do anything for us.
It is because of the sun
that the colors fade.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.570
Haruka!

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.010
Haruka! Do you understand?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.220
Stay calm! It's not your fault.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:06.950
Forget about it.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.000
Listen, you need to stay strong-

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.100
Touya.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:10.910
What is it?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.840
I'm fine, you know.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.250
I'm fine.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.830
The one I'm worried about is...

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.720
I see.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.240
That's good.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:25.010
I don't know what I'd do if you couldn't handle the shock or something.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.750
Regarding the recent doubts that have surfaced concerning Mr. Ogata Eiji,

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.490
it seems that the "Ogata Rina Smoking Scandal" of three years ago

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:42.020
may have been fabricated by the man himself.

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:45.140
It is also suspected that the money that was thought to have been stolen by a department head

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:47.250
was actually secretly taken by him,

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.470
and used to finance the purchase of his paintings overseas...

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.570
Known for refusing to appear on television, among other things,

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:57.760
the mysteriously charming singer, Matsuyama Menou-san, who has recently risen rapidly in popularity,

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.510
has had all of her released songs to date,

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:01.390
the vocals, the composing, and the performances,

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:06.070
all dubbed by others, according to the shocking confession as published...

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:10.080
She's confessed to skipping school, deeds of
misconduct, and delinquency as a teenage girl

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:14.470
in today's publication of the "Inside the Talent World Weekly" magazine.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.570
What's this?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.290
Sorry about this, it's nothing serious.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.660
Wanna go home together?

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:26.260
I've gotta remain hospitalized for two or three days for examinations.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.780
I didn't let Misaki-san know yet.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.520
I didn't get the chance to contact her.

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:31.370
It's fine.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:32.940
Her coming here would just trouble me.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.360
I see.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:36.690
In that case, there's something I'd like to ask of you.

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.110
In that case?

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.570
You didn't come here to see how I was doing?

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.510
Either way, I'm also here to see how Haruka's doing.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.670
So you really don't know.

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:51.110
Ogata Eiji's in big trouble.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:55.760
Yuki-

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.320
Wait!

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:00.460
But Yuki's-

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.310
Nothing'll come from your panicking!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.220
Then what am I supposed to do?!

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:07.450
I made a phone call to Echoes.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.710
The master said not to worry.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:12.910
He said they were set up, and they also know who did it.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.140
They're all definitely innocent.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.070
It seems that Yuki's also been moved to a hotel

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.900
until all the commotion in the media dies down.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:24.890
You won't be able to contact her for a while, though.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:26.150
Right in the middle of a river...

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:31.790
It's like

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:32.500
I'm left behind in a muddy river

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:33.450
By the way, is Matsuyama Menou...

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.680
with Ogata Rina now?

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:36.680
Yeah.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:39.910
She apparently confessed that all her songs were dubbed.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:40.420
I know.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:41.990
She told me herself.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.380
She's at your place?!

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.400
Deduce how you met her before?

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.190
That's what you want me to do?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.630
Just try and remember yourself!

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.780
No matter how I think about it, that time during Christmas Eve wasn't the only time we've met.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.650
Do you think it's a coincidence she called herself a savior-goddess?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:14.560
Don't you think she just thinks of herself as one?

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.780
Why won't she reveal the truth?

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.290
What is that savior-goddess hiding?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.810
The problem here is that you're forgetting a savior-goddess.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.960
What number goddess is Matsuyama Menou?

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.060
The 15th?

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:29.230
The 150th?

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:30.890
Or could she be the 320th-

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.750
Can you go home?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:38.350
I wish Menou-san would tell me what year, what month, and what day we met.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.790
Then you shouldn't be asking me!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.140
Especially since you had to deliberately make the trip here.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.870
I guess you're right.

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.170
I'll ask her which number savior-goddess she is when I get back.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:49.090
Sorry for being a bother.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:49.960
A huge one at that.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:58.410
Akira, I'm glad it wasn't anything serious.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:02.650
I don't want to lose anything anymore.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:23.100
You bitch! Just what the hell do you want?

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.510
Matsuyama Menou-san told me to.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.190
I did what you told me to do.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.320
I even paid you, and you-

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:29.990
I'll pay you back.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.920
I'll get you for this.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:32.870
What are you going to do?

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:33.550
Stab me?

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.630
What? You want me to?!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:36.940
Stab me, then.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:38.440
Come here and stab me.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:41.250
I won't bleed even a single drop of blood.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:41.910
... maru...

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.920
Are you fucking with me?!

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:45.980
Tamaru-san, Tama-

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.540
What the fuck do you want?!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.460
I heard directly from Rina-san...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.590
that the smoking scandal from a couple years ago...

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.730
seems to actually be false...

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.110
So what?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:01.900
That's why everyone out there in such an uproar right now!

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.220
You stupid fuck, don't you have a television at home?!

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:08.000
I was watching a video this morning, so I missed the news...

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:15.560
I have no idea who talked, but thanks to them my grand plan is ruined!

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.660
Listen, I need you to sneak into M3.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.030
Get me something, anything!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.950
I'll screw them over!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:22.890
Your answer?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.990
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:29.710
When the police attempted to speak to her producer at the time,

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.840
who had embezzled funds and then vanished...

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:36.030
They really know how to dig bad stuff back up!

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.000
I can't believe that whole scandal was false...

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.130
It's true.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.590
It's true?

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:46.480
Though my brother and Yayoi-san probably didn't notice,

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.660
I was found out.

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:52.180
I thought various things were odd at first.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.540
I was introduced to a man from the event company,

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:58.620
who I remember had come to my home several times when I was little.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:03.280
When I met him at Echoes last year, I realized.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:04.570
He was Nagase-san.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.020
Your Daddy Longlegs?

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:10.800
Why did Ei-chan have to stage something like that?

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.290
It was a lesson.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:16.630
For me, a rookie at the time, to practice how to deal with a scandal.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.790
It's just like Ei-chan-

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.050
-to do that, right?

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:23.760
Then, about the money he allegedly stole and used to buy the paintings...

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.030
I don't think that's right.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.050
He bought those paintings with the money he earned.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:34.490
The money that he'd allegedly run away with was used to remodel the basement.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.200
As for the head of production who vanished,

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:39.320
he's actually the president of the engineering company who did the construction work.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.740
Rina-san, did you investigate that?

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.930
A little bit.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:46.370
Wait a minute. In other words-

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:50.640
The media's making a big deal out of a bunch of adults playing a game of "secret base".

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.390
President?

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:56.130
Give me some time to think.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.350
My brother shock was directed at the wrong thing.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:13.770
However, he was even more surprised when he realized that Echoes was actually a home for Yuki, Fujii-kun, and the others.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:19.440
That's a nice story, but Ei-chan's in real trouble this time.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.830
Yes.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:24.750
He's off his rocker, but he's not someone who'd commit a crime.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.070
I know that.

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:28.370
But that's not enough to satisfy the masses.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.420
No matter how he messes up, it's my brother's problem.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.040
Rina-san?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.790
What's more, we need decide what we're going to do with Menou-san.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:37.920
Am I right?

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.310
We?

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:40.010
Rina-san...

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.180
So you knew about it too, right?

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:43.970
Yes.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:49.270
Why did things turn out like this?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.090
That fool.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.310
I don't understand.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:57.770
Why did you dub the voice of your own daughter?

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.650
Why did you let it happen?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.790
Or was it on your orders?

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:06.700
When I came here, when I started up again, it was already all set.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:15.610
Menou couldn't ignore that girl, Natsuko, or her talent.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.840
And I wanted the money.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:22.020
Everyone's leaving.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.390
They're running away.

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:25.570
Sarii's also switching companies...

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:28.400
What will you do from now on, Rina-san?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.400
What are you going to do with Menou-san?

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:31.900
You're making me tell you?

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:35.230
She's no longer a singer or a musician.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.360
I understand.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.220
I'll perform at the Venus Festival.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.350
Huh?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:45.820
I'll sing "Secret Chaos" in Menou-san's place.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.590
That's... I don't mind if you want to withdraw.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.240
It'll shame you...

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.890
Are you stopping me?

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:55.650
Can you... do it?

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.810
I've sung it many, many times.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:15.900
I've been looking at you since a long time ago

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:22.340
I've fallen madly in love with you

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:30.290
The sound of the car radio fades far away

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:40.430
In the many heartbeats, unavoidable destiny

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:49.430
Please look only at the real me, more and more

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:55.220
Now that the two of us are alone together

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.920
You're asking when and where we met?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.150
I'm not hiding it.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.270
It's just that you can't remember it, right?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.050
Then tell me.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.570
You were little, Touya-kun.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.890
Was it that long ago?

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.490
Hey, why aren't you making any moves?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.120
Are you a late bloomer?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:15.870
Or...

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.910
All I'm doing is giving you shelter.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.390
If you get found out it's none of my business.

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:25.790
Why did you let the word out that you weren't really singing?

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:26.890
Aren't you happy?

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:29.580
Now the Venus Festival belongs to your dear Rina-chan.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:32.000
Rina-san and I don't have that kind of relationship-

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.620
You're as dull as ever.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.230
Though, it's pretty cute.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.490
I'm going to sleep.

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:41.150
It's because I didn't want Touya-kun to be taken from me.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.680
You told me I'd always be your savior-goddess, right?

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:52.080
I want to gently know you if you are true

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:54.720
Cowardice-

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:56.470
Shut the fuck up!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:57.980
Do you have any idea how damn late it is?!

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:07.030
Final rehearsal -Venus Festival

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.150
It's Yuki.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:07.860
I'm sorry I haven't contacted you this whole time.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:11.120
Tomorrow's the rehearsal for the music festival, isn't it?

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.730
I'm doing fine.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:13.780
Bye.

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:17.600
This is Shinozuka.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.920
I don't think you should come to tomorrow's rehearsal...

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.010
Don't come, no matter what.

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.360
It's for Yuki-san's sake.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.810
And perhaps Rina-san's, too.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.820
I agree.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.700
Do you know someone called Tamaru?

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.520
Are you ready?

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.670
Whoa, it's Ogata Rina!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.890
Yayoi-san, let's go!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.800
All right, looking good!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.070
Can I do it once more?

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:55.990
We're tight on time, so...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.690
All right.

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:20.220
Towards the streets illuminated by twilight

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:27.380
We walk together hand in hand

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:32.640
If I could remain beside you like this

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:39.510
I won't need anything else

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:43.590
Like a dream

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:49.880
Time passes us by

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:56.440
As we wave our hands to say goodbye

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:01.890
I start to want to cry

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:08.720
The loneliness shut inside my heart

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:15.810
Slowly piles up like falling snow

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.710
I cannot sleep

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:27.840
I really want to see if this happiness is real

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.670
All right, good work!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.970
Why must I withdraw?

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:44.140
Can you withstand the unrelenting eyes of the public?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:47.440
Even though Ogata-san didn't do anything wrong,

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.060
and I've gone through so much to come this far...

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:51.240
I don't want to go back.

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.530
Yuki-san?

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.230
Ogata-san, it's Yuki.

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:25.510
It's okay, I'm fine.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.700
I... can't go on.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:28.790
No...

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:32.730
Everything's gone.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:36.410
My paintings, my hideout, my company, my name,

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:38.210
my Rina, and my dreams...

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:40.860
Everything, everything...

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.370
I'm here.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.660
I'm here, so...

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.680
Yuki...

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:51.580
So don't cry...

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:19.950
N-No!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.610
Since I had to perform all of a sudden,

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.590
I wasn't quite myself, but...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.330
I somehow got through the rehearsal.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:47.520
Have all the... errands with your father been taken care of smoothly?

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.400
The day after tomorrow's the real show...

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.620
Of course, I'm not forcing you to, but...

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.880
I'd be happy if you could come to see me.

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:55.910
Well, goodnight.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.970
Are you sure you don't need a ride?

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:05.130
Don't worry about it.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.660
Thanks for your hard work.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.620
Good evening!

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:53.760
Yuki?

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.490
What's wrong, Yuki?

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:56.250
What's wrong?

00:21:57.890 --> 00:22:00.610
Ogata-san... Eiji-san, he...

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:10.310
Yuki's

00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:15.240
no longer

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:15.240
the air

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:20.650
So, you've finally appeared.

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:22.400
The real...

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:30.030
You've reached the police. What's wrong?

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:31.720
This is Ogata.

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:33.200
Ogata Eiji.

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:36.010
Now

00:22:36.010 --> 00:22:39.970
she's just

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:55.920
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:55.920
You have always been kind to me

00:22:56.850 --> 00:23:02.490
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:56.850 --> 00:23:02.490
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:11.330
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:11.330
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:17.940
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:17.940
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.140 --> 00:23:26.310
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.140 --> 00:23:26.310
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:36.260
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:36.260
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:44.000
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:44.000
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:51.910
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:51.910
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:59.380
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:59.380
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:09.360
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:09.360
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:23.180
Page 25

00:24:24.310 --> 00:24:25.510
It's everyone else's fault.

00:24:25.510 --> 00:24:27.870
It's not my fault.

00:24:27.870 --> 00:24:29.900
It's all everyone else's fault.

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:30.980
It's none of my-

00:24:32.080 --> 00:24:33.110
White Album.
